data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"reasoning_content":"\u003cdiv class=\"cs-component-app-shell-11\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e` with no text and no links). The application passes no nav items (App.jsx: `\u003cHeader title=\"Colour Greeting\" /\u003e`), so \"no nav items, no actions\" is satisfied at the application level. The empty `\u003cnav\u003e` is internal to `@codesweep-ai/ui`'s Header. That's a PASS against the design's intent, and I'll note the observation in the report.\n\nAlso confirmed: h1 inline style is `color: var(--color-cat-1);` — token-driven, and it changed on clicks (measured via computed style).\n\nEverything passes:\n\n1. ✅ Greeting exact text \"Hello, world!\" as h1\n2. ✅ Three buttons: Blue, Orange, Violet\n3. ✅ Blue → --color-cat-1 (#6f93c9), Orange → --color-cat-6 (#d89259), Violet → --color-cat-5 (#9e90cc) — verified via computed style after clicks\n4. ✅ Default on load = Blue token\n5. ✅ Header title \"Colour Greeting\", no nav items (empty nav skeleton from the design-system component)\n6. ✅ Footer \"Built with the codesweep design system\"\n7. ✅ Centred layout: h1 and button row horizontally centered (0px offset), group vertically centered (6px rounding), header top, footer bottom, even 12px gaps\n8. ✅ package.json lists @codesweep-ai/ui ^0.3.0\n9. ✅ data-component attributes: AppShell, Header, Button×3, Footer\n10. ✅ No hex in application source; greeting color via var(--color-*) inline style; layout uses --space-* tokens\n\nLet me also stop the serve process, write the report to the output dir, and reply. Also per orientation: \"Commit your work to your own branch\" — but qa.md says \"you commit nothing\" since I'm on a detached HEAD and QA doesn't modify the app. My work product is the report in the output dir. qa.md explicitly says \"A detached HEAD is fine, because you commit nothing.\" So no commit needed — the report goes to the output dir.\n\nLet me kill the serve process, write the report."},"finish_reason":null,"index":0,"raw_output":null}],"created":1793343844,"id":"chatcmpl-83ec63c9","model":"accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k3","object":"chat.completion.chunk","usage":null}

